        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`. After a lot of internal back and forth, it indeed seems to be more reasonable to follow the (undocumented) \"put on the right edge in Visual mode\" than the (documented) \"put on the left edge after operator action\". Thanks again for the suggestion!",
